  "question": {
    "text": "If equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;represents a hyperbola, then",
    "image": null
  },
