  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, equation of hyperbola is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math> can be rewritten as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p>This is of the form of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math></p><p>Where, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;is any point on the hyperbola and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> is a focus and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> is the point of directrix.</p><p>Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>&#955;</mi></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
